// One record per human. Hand-maintained; this is the source of truth.
//
//   emails[]  collapses multiple git identities (work + personal) onto one person
//   orgs[]    affiliation spans: `from` inclusive, `until` exclusive, both optional
//   rosterNames[]  exact MAINTAINERS.md name spellings that are this person —
//             identity aliases like emails, never a list of councils. Which
//             councils a person sits on is read from the roster every run.
//
// Wrong about you? Edit your record and open a PR — self-reported beats anything
// we can infer. Absent from this file means nobody has looked yet, which is a
// different fact from `independent` (looked, personal capacity) and
// `undisclosed` (looked, no public affiliation found).
